<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 7-year govt bond average price 103.42 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 7-year govt bond average price 103.42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average price on the latest issue of Hungary's seven-year government bonds was set by auction at 103.42 percent, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    2003/F BOND</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     17,752 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 6,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average price		  103.42 pct</p>
<p>Note: The bond, issued on October 17, 1996, bears a floating interest rate of year-on-year consumer price inflation plus three percent, and is calculated twice yearly, on March 20 and September 20. Interest is paid annually on September 24.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
